        ("Starting with an empty stack, after which sequence does isEmpty() return True without any error?", ["push(1), push(2), pop()", "push(1), push(2), pop(), pop()", "push(1), pop(), push(2)", "push(1), push(2), peek(), peek()"], 1, "Two pushes and two pops remove both items. peek() does not remove anything."),
